      "content": "Given the goal to maintain high CSAT while managing costs, I recommend offering a partial refund or a significant future credit for the inconvenience, rather than a full immediate refund. This acknowledges the customer's frustration without fully admitting liability for the damage. Log the incident as \"Dispute - Undetermined Cause,\" noting the favorable in-transit sensor data to support future claims if necessary.",
