    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, so if we do the full refund as a \"goodwill gesture,\" how should I word the actual response to the customer and what should the internal log entry say about the sensor data? I want to make sure we're being clear that we aren't admitting it was our mistake, but I don't want to sound like we're accusing them of anything or starting a fight.",
